OL,3,GNEWSABaby girl found dead on shoreline
OL,4,Agiven name by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby girl whose body was found on a
OL,7,Fnorth Wales shoreline has been given
OL,8,Fthe name Ceri by police.
OL,10,FThe body was found by a member of the
OL,11,Fpublic on the Menai Strait shoreline
OL,12,Fnear Siliwen Road in Bangor, Gwynedd,
OL,13,Fon 27 September shortly before 17:00
OL,14,FBST.
OL,16,FA post-mortem examination revealed the
OL,17,Fnewborn may have been in the water for
OL,18,Fup to a few weeks. North Wales Police
OL,19,Fwas still searching for the mother and
OL,20,Furged her to contact them.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
