OL,3,GNEWSABaby girl found dead on shoreline
OL,4,Agiven name by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers are also appealing to anyone
OL,7,Fwho routinely walked in the Ashley
OL,8,FFields areas of Bangor since 30 August
OL,9,Fto come forward.
